{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Long ago, there was a peaceful village inhabited by artisans...</strong> <strong>Until the dark wizard Kravenox arrived.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatherlands is a magical 2d adventure game that combines elements of exploration, survival, and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a young wizard trapped in ice. Your goal: to save your village, put an end to the darkness, and reunite the lost artisans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and survival:</strong> Wander mysterious islands, gather resources, discover new areas, and survive in different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.poster.avif?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.webm?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.mp4?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and production:</strong> Dig, chop, craft! Produce tools, weapons, and items with the materials you collect. Strengthen your progress by building structures like furnaces, workbenches, and anvils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and animal husbandry:</strong> Establish your own farm, sow seeds, and grow your produce. Tame and feed your animals, and collect resources like milk and eggs from them. You manage every stage of production to keep your village alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and dungeons:</strong> Different puzzles and dangerous dungeons await you on every island. Escape traps, fight powerful bosses, and seize legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue the villagers:</strong> Every villager you rescue from the ice breathes new life into your village. The blacksmith strengthens your weapons, the cook feeds you, the merchant increases your earnings. Each one offers unique support on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.poster.avif?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.webm?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.mp4?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet friends:</strong> Train your pet, explore the world with it. It brings back items you collect and grants passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression:</strong> Unlock new abilities, expand your inventory, and improve your wizard with passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you one step closer to Kravenox. Gatherlands is not just a game about gathering resources and surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story\u2026 a journey\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island is a new secret, every rescued villager is a new hope. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the warmth of your necklace, your destiny changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your village, defeat the darkness, and rewrite the Gatherlands legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to chat, leave feedback, or follow the development together, we welcome you to discord. seeing you among us would truly make us happy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899610?t=1765564707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/f4968892449b86c2f075cf6685caffb0ebe14bd6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765564707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/18d1df03610df08ff255d03ae2cfc687fd26cc0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765564707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/18d1df03610df08ff255d03ae2cfc687fd26cc0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765564707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Long ago, there was a peaceful village inhabited by artisans...</strong> <strong>Until the dark wizard Kravenox arrived.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatherlands is a magical 2d adventure game that combines elements of exploration, survival, and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a young wizard trapped in ice. Your goal: to save your village, put an end to the darkness, and reunite the lost artisans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and survival:</strong> Wander mysterious islands, gather resources, discover new areas, and survive in different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.poster.avif?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.webm?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.mp4?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and production:</strong> Dig, chop, craft! Produce tools, weapons, and items with the materials you collect. Strengthen your progress by building structures like furnaces, workbenches, and anvils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and animal husbandry:</strong> Establish your own farm, sow seeds, and grow your produce. Tame and feed your animals, and collect resources like milk and eggs from them. You manage every stage of production to keep your village alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and dungeons:</strong> Different puzzles and dangerous dungeons await you on every island. Escape traps, fight powerful bosses, and seize legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue the villagers:</strong> Every villager you rescue from the ice breathes new life into your village. The blacksmith strengthens your weapons, the cook feeds you, the merchant increases your earnings. Each one offers unique support on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.poster.avif?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.webm?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.mp4?t=1765564707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet friends:</strong> Train your pet, explore the world with it. It brings back items you collect and grants passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression:</strong> Unlock new abilities, expand your inventory, and improve your wizard with passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you one step closer to Kravenox. Gatherlands is not just a game about gathering resources and surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story\u2026 a journey\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island is a new secret, every rescued villager is a new hope. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the warmth of your necklace, your destiny changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your village, defeat the darkness, and rewrite the Gatherlands legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1765564707\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to chat, leave feedback, or follow the development together, we welcome you to discord. seeing you among us would truly make us happy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bugurca Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/c2e142d08370885540357b4a82c99011dff461c1/header.jpg?t=1765564707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3899610/1263170028/cd0ac3ecf043dc6cb124f35aa29765b7c96fa1df/1765550814/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765554020","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3899610/1263170028/cd0ac3ecf043dc6cb124f35aa29765b7c96fa1df/1765550814/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765554020","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea